    "q-183280": {
      "dom_id": "step-q183280",
      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "$\\,$ $x$ is not an even integer, and $x$ divides $50.$\n\nExpress the compound predicate above in symbolic form given the following:\n\n- $C(x):$ $x$ is an even integer\n\n- $D(x):$ $x$ divides $50$",
      "worked_solution": "The sentence \n\n$\\,$ $x$ is not an even integer.\n\ncan be expressed symbolically as $¬C.$\n\nTherefore, the given sentence is expressed symbolically as \n\n$$\n¬C∧D.\n$$",
